    "name": "BetSolutions Wallet Player API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Two-mode wallet integration for casino operators. Transfer mode provides deposit, withdraw, and balance operations managed by BetSolutions. Seamless mode enables operator-side wallet management where BetSolutions calls the operator's server for bet, win, cancel, and balance operations.",
